The implementation of this function is optimized for both time and space complexity, with caching strategies and batch processing to minimize I/O overhead, and graceful handling of failures like file permission issues or unexpected data formats. The code also integrates well with external dependencies, such as third-party libraries for logging and threading, and includes a simple command-line interface for testing the function.']

