The code also includes retry mechanisms and fallback strategies for handling intermittent connectivity issues and delays in data reception, ensuring robustness and reliability under varying network conditions. The function monitors the memory usage of the dynamic array and reports breaches of predefined thresholds to a distributed logging system for performance analysis and troubleshooting.

