The `lte_ue_context_serialize()` function takes a filename as an argument and writes the contents of the linked list to it in a compact, efficient format using the `fwrite()` system call. The `lte_ue_context_deserialize()` function does the opposite, reading the contents of the file and populating the linked list with them.

