## Introduction
This C function is designed to manage a dynamic list of LTE UE context information structures, each containing UE ID, bearer status, and QoS parameters. The function must support concurrent access from multiple threads while ensuring thread safety and efficient memory management. It will use a lock-free or atomic-based approach where feasible to reduce contention and improve performance under high-load conditions.

